## ✅ TASK 2: Create Feature Files
**Objective:** Write BDD scenarios in Gherkin language

**Create File:** `src/test/resources/features/users.feature`
**Content Type:** Gherkin
**Scenarios Include:**
- Get all users
- Get user by ID
- Create a new user
- Update user
- Delete user

---

## ✅ TASK 3: Create Base API Class
**Objective:** Build reusable HTTP client for API requests

**Create File:** `src/main/java/com/framework/api/BaseAPI.java`
**Methods:**
- getRequest(endpoint)
- postRequest(endpoint, body)
- putRequest(endpoint, body)
- deleteRequest(endpoint)
- patchRequest(endpoint, body)

**Features:**
- Base URL configuration
- Request specification setup
- Response extraction
- Content type handling

---

## ✅ TASK 4: Write Step Definitions
**Objective:** Map Gherkin steps to Java code

**Create File:** `src/test/java/com/framework/stepdefs/UserStepDefinitions.java`

**Step Types to Implement:**
- @Given steps - Set up test data (base URL, endpoint, request body)
- @When steps - Perform API calls (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)
- @Then steps - Validate responses (status code, content verification)

**Methods:**
- setBaseURL(url)
- setEndpoint(endpoint)
- setRequestBody(data)
- makeGetRequest()
- makePostRequest()
- makePutRequest()
- makeDeleteRequest()
- verifyStatusCode(expectedCode)
- verifyUsersList()
- verifyUsername(username)

---

## ✅ TASK 5: Create Test Runner
**Objective:** Configure Cucumber to run feature files

**Create File:** `src/test/java/com/framework/runners/TestRunner.java`

**Configuration:**
- Extend: AbstractTestNGCucumberTests
- Features path: src/test/resources/features
- Glue path: com.framework.stepdefs, com.framework.hooks
- Plugins:
  - pretty (console output)
  - html report (target/cucumber-reports/index.html)
  - json report (target/cucumber.json)
  - junit report (target/cucumber.xml)

**Options:**
- monochrome = true
- dryRun = false
- publish = true

---

## ✅ TASK 6: Create Hooks
**Objective:** Set up pre-test and post-test configurations

**Create File:** `src/test/java/com/framework/hooks/Hooks.java`

**Methods:**
- @Before - setUp(Scenario)
  - Print test start message
  - Initialize resources
  - Log scenario name

- @After - tearDown(Scenario)
  - Check if test passed/failed
  - Print test end message
  - Cleanup resources

---

## ✅ TASK 7: Create Configuration Manager
**Objective:** Manage external configuration properties

**Create File:** `src/main/java/com/framework/config/ConfigManager.java`

**Methods:**
- loadProperties() - Static initialization
- getProperty(key) - Get string value
- getProperty(key, defaultValue) - Get with default
- getIntProperty(key) - Get integer value
- getBooleanProperty(key) - Get boolean value

**Also Create:** `src/main/resources/config.properties`

**Properties:**
- api.base.url = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com
- api.connection.timeout = 10000
- api.socket.timeout = 10000
- test.environment = qa
- logging.level = INFO

---

## ✅ TASK 8: Create Assertion Utilities
**Objective:** Build reusable assertion methods

**Create File:** `src/main/java/com/framework/utils/AssertionUtils.java`

**Methods:**
- assertStatusCode(response, expectedCode)
- assertStatusCodeOK(response) - Assert 200
- assertStatusCodeCreated(response) - Assert 201
- assertResponseContains(response, text)
- assertResponseNotNull(response)
- assertResponseNotEmpty(response)
- assertResponseHasJsonPath(response, jsonPath)

